From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Audit Hub <audit-hub@audit-hub.invalid>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 17:00:55 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 01/10] fix(auth): end the access tokens too when every session
 ends

revokeAll() ended the refresh sessions but left every access token
already issued valid for up to 15 minutes. It now raises the account's
securityVersion in the same transaction through endSessionsLocked(),
which a change that must end access at once (an account disabled, a
role taken away) calls inside its own transaction.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
